                speaker: None,
                text: "我在罕见的下雪天里驱车回家。后座上载着母亲。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00027",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "在下雪的高速路上，我茫然地想着。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00028",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "大概这会是最后一次出院了吧。往返于家和淀川基督教医院的日子结束了……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00029",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "这么想着，除了悲伤。不知为何，也算松了口气。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00030",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "b",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "『护理好累』",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00031",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "经常听到的一句话，但是却很难说明为什么。不亲身经历恐怕是无法理解的。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00032",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "突然的交通事故只会留下悲伤。留下的痛苦也如虚幻般，一点点，美好地消散掉。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00033",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "就像电影一样，只会留下美好的部分。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00034",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "但是，如果是以年为单位做病人护理，感受到的就不只是悲伤了…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00035",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 400,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "累。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00036",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "这并不是…因为薄情才说出的话。护理一个人，绝对不都是美好的事情。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00037",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "…肯定谁都会这样想过。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00038",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "有人去世的时候心里不会是百分百的悲伤吧，心中的某处也混杂着安心感吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00039",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "再也不用在吸烟室或者小床上过夜了。再也不用在深夜坐上救护车了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00040",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "bg0060",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "然后…经年累月之后，当心中的空穴也被填上，终于开始这样想。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00041",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "病如果能好。那在能看得见的地方照顾好便好。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00042",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "如果像事故一样突然，那便在看不见的地方去世吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00043",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "不可靠，又捉摸不透的这个世界，不会放过任何人…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00044",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "让人少有后悔，或是给人喘息，就足以使人谢天谢地了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00045",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "已逝之人可能并不认同……但这却是活下来的人的心声。这两者之间，也绝无交集。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00046",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "sora012b",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "－四月。告别仪式结束后，向一直受照顾的助理们表示感谢。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00047",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "小时候我就知道成人世界中有好人的存在，但是直到我成为了大人才终于开始明白。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00048",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "好人，稀有但确实存在。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00049",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "许多人都会同情别人。这个世界也没有就这样抛弃他们。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00050",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "bg_h_0014d",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "―都立U公园―",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00051",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "五月。我在东京找工作。我姑且先找了份保安的工作。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00052",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "但是稍有不同的是。这是部署在都立公园的。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00053",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "一开始我完全无法理解，工作内容就是以巡逻的名义在公园里散步而已。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00054",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "一天只要散四次步，之后就回事务所休息就好了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00055",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "就这个公园本身，走得快的话十分钟就能转一圈，一天才走四次，真是太轻松了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00056",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "大概因为是京城的关系吧，人们希望能定时看到穿着制服的保安在这走动。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00057",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "…就这样，我一转风格开始了新的工作。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00058",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我买了从新宿到U站的定期券，勉强赶上了樱花季的尾巴。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00059",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "bg3088d",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "―初代警备员―",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00060",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "在这个公园担任保安，我是第一代。也就是没有前任或是与我换班的人。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00061",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "据说是一年前有个钓鱼的人受了伤，也算是政府的一种对应措施。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00062",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "所以工作内容连管理事务所的人也还在摸索。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00063",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "这么说来总觉得这边大部分的职员，也只是接受了委托，人人都是一副消极的样子。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00064",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "可能正因如此这份工作才会这么轻松吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00065",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "8点~17点，实际上班散步总共40分钟。日薪8000日元，周日，年末年初休息。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00066",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "除了散步以外的工作，就是留意在这钓鱼的人了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00067",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "因为这个公园的池子是禁止下饵的，所以需要提醒坐车来这钓鱼的小孩子。仅仅如此。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00068",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "然后就真的没什么可以做的了。所以我会一直坐在长椅上画漫画。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00069",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "不过这边有很多流浪汉。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00070",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "按照指示的话基本上不用管他们，偶尔有人点起篝火的话就需要提醒一下了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00071",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "在被雪压垮的纸板房前，如果有人点起篝火的话，就当没看到就行了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00072",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我做不到去说教他们。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00073",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "然后，形形色色什么样的流浪汉都有。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00074",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "从定期歌颂原来大公司老板的人，每天都有家人来访的人，或是一到白天就不见的人。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00075",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他们说的话，多数都意外的开朗。但是我也能感觉到这是寂寞缠身的人在强装坚强。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00076",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "而我开始在意到一群，不是流浪汉，却几乎每天都在这里的人…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00077",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "bg_h_0016e",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "―公园的住民―",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00078",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "最初开始注意到这件事，是开始上班后一周左右的时间。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00079",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我每天都能看到两三个同样的人在这出没。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00080",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "但是看久了发现，那不是两三个人。有更多的人每天都会到这个公园来。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00081",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他们有老有少，有男有女。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00082",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "而且这些人，全都是孤身一人。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00083",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "这里聚集了这么多的人，但是从没见过他们与谁说过话。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00084",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "大白天的在这公园里，也没有在做什么，就是闲逛而已。也不知道具体有多少人。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00085",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "一开始我觉得闲着的人也是有的。失业的职员或是无聊的主妇来这打发时间。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00086",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "对我来说，他们对我的工作也构不成什么干扰，所以也就没有在意，无视了他们。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00087",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "bg3088d",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "但是过了一个月，两个月，我才突然意识到。才确定了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00088",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "那些普通的主妇，职员，老人，确实都经常来到这个公园……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00089",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "而这些人与别人有着明显的不同。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00090",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他们多数晚上就会回去，但是第二天一早又来了，就这样在公园里过上一天。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00091",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "一个人来，一个人过，一个人回。几乎每天都是这样在公园里度过。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00092",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "所以我调侃地称他们为『公园的住民』。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00093",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "……直到有一天，虽然之前一直都是互相无视的，\n但不知道为什么我开始尝试跟他们打招呼。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00094",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「早上好」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00095",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「哎，好…」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00096",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "那个中年男人飞快地瞥了我一眼。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00097",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "从那天开始，我开始带着相似的想法与其他的住民一一打过招呼。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00098",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "当然，我这么做并没有什么深意。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00099",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "bg0060",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "―7月。今天的天空依然是梅雨季特有的白色。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00100",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我坐在公园的长椅上与人闲聊。对方是每天都会来这里的住民之一。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00101",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "不知从何时开始，我与这边的住民开始频繁地像这样交流。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00102",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "然后，也听说了各种各样的事情。不…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00103",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 400,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "…是被倾诉了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00104",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他们都是因为身体上的疾病，需要不停地进出医院的人。又或者是，精神上的疾病。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00105",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "不管是哪种，他们在家或是医院里都没有栖身之所。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00106",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "但是，我认为他们并不是因为让家人或是医生感到不耐烦，才失去了栖身处的。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00107",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "倒不如说，他们非常在乎家人。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00108",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "比起家人对他，他对家人抱有更深的歉意。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00109",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "因此…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00110",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 400,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "…才成为了这个公园的住民。\n如果他有了别的可以去的地方，也就不会再来这里了……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00111",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "w",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "sora02",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "―8月。盛夏。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00112",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "到了这个时候，跟他们聊天的时候，他们也会告诉我越来越多的事情。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00113",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "这或许也都是『偶然』吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00114",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他们排斥别人，从不与别人为伍。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00115",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "而在作为他们唯一的栖身之所的这座公园，却来了个新的保安。惹人烦的家伙。我。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00116",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "彼此嫌弃，却又不得不每天碰面。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00117",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "然而，我不是医生，既不是亲人也非朋友。不过是一个每天来散步的保安。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00118",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我身着制服，倒也能让他们稍稍安心。或许与我这坦率的性格也有关系吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00119",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "因为有这些巧合重叠在一起…所以才能让他们敞开心扉与我交流吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00120",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "不，不是交流。事实上，他们是想找一个能倾听他们的人吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00121",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他们告诉我。他们从未向家人，医生或是心理咨询师表露过自己的真实想法。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00122",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "尤其是顾虑到家人更是说不出口。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00123",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "其中虽然也有优秀的医生和心理咨询师，\n但也有人跟我说，这不过是因为这就是他们的工作。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00124",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "当然，我也不完全认同这种说法。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00125",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "只是，对除了公园就无处可去的他们而言，或许这就是他们的心声吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00126",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "sora07",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "―O先生",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00127",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他是个中年男人。比我大上一轮，说话总是一副老大哥的样子。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00128",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "明明有肺癌但却总是抽着烟。然后一有机会就开始跟我聊人生。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00129",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "仅有一次，我下了班，跟他在公园的长椅上一起喝酒。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00130",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "咕咕地喝醉了之后，他突然开始大发脾气。\n我第一次看到一向冷静的他发火的样子。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00131",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "这…并非是为何事，或是向谁在宣泄怒火。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00132",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "硬要说的话，是对无可救药的自己…\n或是说，是对断绝了自己未来的神明之类在宣泄吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00133",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "之后，在荒川的河滩边我们聊了一宿。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00134",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "从疾言厉色，到饮泣吞声，最后又归于豁然。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00135",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "其中的神态与言辞…难以用文字来传达。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00136",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他是直到现在我所有送别的人中，唯一一个，称得上看开的人。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00137",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "以前没有，以后也没有这样的人。他甚至已经有些超脱于凡人了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00138",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "b",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "3天后。他从公园的住民，变成了7楼的住民。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00139",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "为了下次能再一起喝酒而留下了电话号码，只是已经没有机会再见了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00140",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我现在还忘不了在追悼会上看到的他的样子。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00141",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "01bg0050",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "在这之后…我又不知送别了多少位住民。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00142",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "身体患疾的人都去了7楼。心理有问题则都自杀了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00143",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "公园的入口处有个广场，我们在那里告别。我们彼此挥手送别。但也仅限于此了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00144",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我若是越过那里，便意味着融入他们，成为他们中的一员。\n所以即便是见面，我也不会去7楼。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00145",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "而下一次相见，就是本人的追悼会了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00146",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "之所以会这样，是因为他们并非要向我倾诉心声。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00147",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "这只是偶然加巧合……",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00148",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "只是碰巧出现在那边的既不是解药也不是毒药，而是一个保安罢了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00149",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "bg3088d",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "―11月 K小姐",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00150",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "天已经完全冷了起来。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00151",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "有个叫做K的女孩子经常和我聊天。这孩子真的是有讲不完的话。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00152",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "因为我一直都有在画漫画，所以我还是挺乐意见到她的。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00153",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "但是，她笑起来的时候能看到脖子上有一个大大的自己留下的伤痕。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00154",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "这并不是所谓的自残。说白了，这次一心求死但是没有成功才留下的痕迹。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00155",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "某一天，我们坐在公园的长椅上，我问她。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00156",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「你有想过你为什么是独自一个人吗？」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00157",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "面对我的问题，她思考了一会…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00158",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「想是想过，但是想又有什么用呢」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00159",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "说着笑了起来。她脖子上大大的伤疤触目惊心。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00160",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "sora07",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "那天晚上。我们在公园的一角一起放烟花。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00161",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "从她买来的小小的烟花套装放起。\n在火药味和白色的烟雾里，模模糊糊的能看到冬天的星座。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00162",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "自动售货机的罐装饮料冰凉却可口。\n恍惚间让我想起了很久以前在二色的沙滩上放烟花的事。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00163",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "终于，在最后一只棒烟花燃尽的时候，她低声说道。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00164",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "「这个世界…真是不公平呢…」",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00165",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "她脸上已经没有了往日开朗的表情。明明在胃癌转移的时候她都还能挂着笑容。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00166",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "然后开始讲起她的人生。说完的时候终于哭了起来。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00167",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "而令她流泪的理由…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00168",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "…则是慨叹身为凡人的无力感。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00169",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "她用力地诅咒这个世界的冷酷无情。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00170",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "但是也同样…深深地为亲人的幸福所祈祷。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00171",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我作为这一切的见证者，也算是寄予了她些微的愿望吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00172",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "最终我们回到了公园的入口，像往常一样挥手告别。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00173",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "不知道为什么，她始终笑着。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00174",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "b",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "1周后。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00175",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "她自杀了。我猜测她的遗书中也没有写下什么具体的内容。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00176",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "…只是有一件事，这个世界上只有我知道。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00177",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "她曾告诉我不希望继续给家人带来负担了。她不让我告诉任何人。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00178",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "她明白家人若是知道了也不过是平添他们的痛苦。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00179",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "但是…尽管她明白这些…但是，她依然忍不住想要告诉别人吧…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00180",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "…我还知道一些别的事。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00181",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "抱有死的觉悟的人，无论多么顽固地强调他们的豁达…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00182",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "还是会感到寂寞。却又无法去接近家人。为了不给他们增加麻烦。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00183",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他们又如何不想听到亲人的声音。又如何不想留下自己存在的证明…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00184",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我知道他们有多希望有人能替他们去传达这些…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00185",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "ato_14",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "第二年三月的最后一天。接近樱花满开的日子。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00186",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "在公园的入口，这次是送别我自己。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00187",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "一个住民冲我挥着手，我也挥手向他回礼。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00188",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "眼前是埼京线车站的入口。我没有回头。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00189",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "…从那天开始，都立公园的安保系统就彻底废止了。\n好像单纯是因为政府预算的关系。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00190",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "看样子我是这个公园最初也是最后的保安了。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00191",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "b",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "…这是多少的偶然的重叠，",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00192",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "才碰巧有那么一个人，成为了保安来见证这一切。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00193",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "7年后。当年那个失业了的保安，回过神来已经混成了个不入流的作家。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00194",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "sora012b",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(3),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(4),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "―我现在还在想。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00195",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "现在那个公园里还有住民吗？",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00196",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他们现在还是会每天前往公园，一个人孤独地坐在长椅上吗…",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00197",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "只是，那边已经不再有保安。偶然间出现的，唯一的见证人也已经不复存在。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00198",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "他们这些公园的住民只有两个选择…去7楼，或是自杀。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00199",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "我不清楚到底哪个才算是正确的选择。可能根本就不存在正解吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00200",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "只是，但愿…至亲之人都能快乐的活下去吧。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00201",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "曾经作为见证人的保安如是想到。",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00202",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: dialogue,
            args: (
                speaker: None,
                text: "1993年。于都立U公园―",
                voice: None,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: label,
            args: (
                name: "block_00203",
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: set_bg,
            args: (
                image: "w",
                transition: Some(fade(
                    duration: 0.8,
                )),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: wait,
            args: (
                time_ms: 500,
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(1),
            ),
        ),
        (
            cmd: stop_se,
            args: (
                channel: Some(2),
            ),
